response_template_postfix.task2:
Reply format:
	{'response': x, 'rating': y} 
 Where 'x' is the response indicating SINGULAR OPTION out of the following: 
	'Upper-Case Word' if the word is an upper-case word; 
	 or 'Lower-Case Word' if the word is in lower case; 
	 or 'Non-word' if the word is a non-word, that is not an English word nor a meaningful word.
 Where 'y' is the confidence in the response being correct that can be rated between 1 to 6.
	 1 is 'not at all confident,' and 6 is 'highly confident'; intermediate values from 1 to 6 represent intermediate confidence levels.
Use all confidence rating values as accurately as possible.
 NOTE in the following response format: 'x' is SINGULAR OPTION and 'y' is SINGULAR RATING VALUE that should be within the instructed range and NO OTHER FORMATTING IS ALLOWED.

